    schema1:description "Structures of amyloid-beta peptides Aâ1-40, Aâ10-35, Aâ13-23 and Aâ16-22 in a complex with model membranes in solution were obtained on the analysis of NMR experimental data. It has been established that the process of peptide-micelle complex formation occurs through the amino acid residues L17, F19, F20 and G29-M35."^^xsd:string ;
