        <http://example.org/mesh/_Antigens>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_B-Lymphocytes_>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Blotting>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Callithrix_>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Cell_Line>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Dose-Response_Relationship>,
