        <http://example.org/mesh/_Dose-Response_Relationship>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Enzyme_Activation_>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Gene_Amplification_>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Humans_>,
        <http://example.org/mesh/_Kinetics_>,
